==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|serious|ly}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈsɪɹiəsli/|/ˈsiɹiəsli/}}
* {{audio|en-us-seriously.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# {{context|manner}} In a [[serious]] or [[literal]] manner.
#: ''He was hoping that we would take him '''seriously'''.''
# {{context|speech act}} {{non-gloss definition|Used to attempt to introduce a serious point in a less serious conversation}}
#: ''Now, '''seriously''', why did the chicken cross the road?''

